# Gitignore settings for ESPHome
# This is an example and may include too much for your use-case.
# You can modify this file to suit your needs.
/.esphome/
# ESPHome Device Builder state kept in the config directory: preferences, its
# sidecar, and the peer-link private key. Never commit these.
/.device-builder*
/secrets.yaml
/trash**

# LLM Generated
../*-secrets/
.vscode/
*.log
*.db
secrets.yaml

# HAOS-side push-capable deploy key (slice 7a Plan C step 6) -- lives inside
# the git-tracked tree itself so it persists across HA Core container
# recreation (SPEC §4), so it must be excluded here explicitly.
.ssh/

# yaml-render-agent / HAOS receiver (slice 7a Plan D): a delivery keeps the previous
# secrets file next to the live one and stages the incoming one beside it. This
# repo is public and the HAOS push automation runs `git add -A` in /config/esphome,
# so both must be ignored or the first delivery would publish a secrets file.
secrets.yaml.prev
.secrets.yaml.incoming.*
